---
previewLayout: design-example-wrapper-full
---

{% extends "layouts/design-example-wrapper-full-layout.njk" %}

{% from "breadcrumb/macro.njk" import breadcrumb %}
{% from "button/macro.njk" import button %}
{% from "inset-text/macro.njk" import insetText %}

{% set mainClasses = "nhsuk-main-wrapper--s" %}

{% block beforeContent %}
  {{ breadcrumb({
    items: [
      {
        href: "#",
        text: "Home"
      },
      {
        href: "#",
        text: "NHS services"
      }
    ]
  }) }}
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
  <div class="nhsuk-grid-row">
    <div class="nhsuk-grid-column-two-thirds">

      <h1 class="nhsuk-heading-xl">Register with a GP surgery: Anywhere Medical Centre</h1>
      <p>Use this service to register yourself or someone else with a GP surgery for the first time or to transfer to a new GP surgery.</p>
      <p>Do not use this service if you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>need medical help right now – instead visit <a href="#">NHS 111 online</a></li>
        <li>want to make an urgent appointment – instead you should contact your current GP</li>
        <li>want a temporary registration of less than 3 months – <a href="#">find out about temporary registrations</a></li>
        <li>are already registered with a GP surgery and want other <a href="#">NHS online health and prescription services</a></li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l">How long it takes</h2>
      <p>It takes around 15 minutes to complete a registration.</p>
      <p>You need to complete the process in 1 session.</p>
      <p>Your preferred GP surgery should register you within 1 to 5 working days of receiving your details.</p>

      <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l">Before you start</h2>  
 
      <p>By using this service you agree to our <a href="#">terms of use</a> and confirm that you have read the <a href="#">privacy policy</a>.</p>

      {{ button({
        text: "Start now",
        href: "#"
      }) }}

      <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l">Other ways to register</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fill in the <a href="#">Register with a GP surgery paper form (PDF only, 457 KB, 8 pages)</a> and take it to the surgery you want to join.</li>
        <li>Contact the surgery you want to join directly.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can view <a href="#">guidance about how to register with a GP</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </div>
{% endblock %}
